{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a> with the two properties:\n</p>\n<dl><dd>(a) for any two real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d862492b295f02fdfa8c2947d1a2c89c2977857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+y) = x + f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />, and</dd>\n<dd>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/c/83c9eaafccaf02603a1d99a264b33e558922290d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />.</dd></dl>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccada86dae7ddcd4873622fdc96eaea182ebe3a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1998)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/4/774f856eb73a57123c0c1ea1e5118b92b4efa572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 0  \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 2  \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 1996 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 1998  \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"423\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/6/5d6457cf917203b3385c143415523c45f121254a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(1998 + 0) = 1998 + f(0) = 2000 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(E)}\\]\" width=\"323\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/0/760d78a66f48051931a072637d2b73e3ea9d4fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" /> satisfies these properties. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" r